# SITL-only ArduSub parameters, loaded by sitl_mavros.launch.py after banyu_defaults.parm.
# Never load these onto the real Pixhawk: the robot keeps its own attitude gains
# (ATC_RAT_RLL/PIT_P 0.135, _I 0.09 in the October 2026 dump).
# Stream rates are not set here: this ArduPilot names them MAVx_* (not SRx_*), and
# MAVProxy's --streamrate=10 (sim_vehicle.py, run_mavproxy.sh) already sets them.

# The sim models the BlueROV2 Heavy (bluerov2_heavy model, sim_vehicle -f vectored_6dof);
# the robot is a standard 6-thruster BlueROV2 (FRAME_CONFIG 1).
FRAME_CONFIG 2

# Attitude rate gains the sim was tuned with (vectored 6DOF JSON model).
ATC_RAT_RLL_P 0.6
ATC_RAT_RLL_I 0.15
ATC_RAT_PIT_P 0.6
ATC_RAT_PIT_I 0.15
